/* ---------- Policies (English; editable from Admin) ---------- */
const POL_TITLES={terms:'Terms & Conditions',product:'Product Policy',delivery:'Shipping & Delivery Policy',returns:'Returns, Refunds & Exchange Policy',payment:'Payment Policy',privacy:'Privacy Policy',about:'About Us',faq:'FAQs',intl:'International Shopping & Payments'};
const POL_DEF={
terms:`## 1. Introduction
By accessing or purchasing from {{STORE}} ("we", "us", "our"), you agree to these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use this website.
## 2. Account & Login
- To place an order you must sign in with your mobile number and a one-time password (OTP).
- You are responsible for giving a correct name, mobile number and delivery address. We are not liable for failed deliveries caused by incorrect details.
- Never share your OTP or account details with anyone.
- You must be at least 18 years old to place an order. Minors may purchase only under the supervision of a parent or guardian.
## 3. Pricing & Orders
- All prices are in Indian Rupees (INR) and include applicable taxes (GST).
- Prices, offers and stock may change without prior notice. The price displayed at the time you place the order applies.
- An order is accepted only after we confirm it. Until then it remains a request to purchase.
- We may cancel any order because of pricing or stock errors, suspected fraud, or an undeliverable PIN code. In that case any amount paid will be refunded in full.
## 4. Intellectual Property
The {{STORE}} name, logo, designs, photographs and content belong to us. You may not copy, reproduce or use them commercially without our written permission.
## 5. Acceptable Use
- Do not provide false information or attempt fraudulent transactions.
- Do not attempt to disrupt, hack or misuse the website or its data.
## 6. Limitation of Liability
We make reasonable efforts to keep the website available and accurate. We are not liable for delays or losses caused by events beyond our control, such as internet, courier or payment gateway failures. Our liability for any order will not exceed the amount paid for that order.
## 7. Governing Law
These terms are governed by the laws of India. Disputes are subject to the jurisdiction of the courts at the seller's place of business.
## 8. Grievance Redressal
For any complaint, contact us at {{EMAIL}}, WhatsApp {{WHATSAPP}} or phone {{PHONE}}. We will acknowledge your complaint within 48 hours and aim to resolve it within one month.`,
product:`## 1. Product Information
- We try to describe and photograph every product as accurately as possible. Colours may look slightly different on different screens.
- Handwork, embroidery, handloom weaves, prints and genuine leather naturally vary from piece to piece. Such variations are not defects.
## 2. Sizing
- Women's apparel: please check the size information on the product page before ordering.
- Kids' wear: sizes are given by age group. If your child is between sizes, we suggest choosing the larger size.
- Footwear: sizes are in UK sizing.
- Sarees: length, blouse piece and other details are mentioned in the product description wherever applicable.
- If you are unsure about a size, message us on WhatsApp ({{WHATSAPP}}) before ordering.
## 3. Fabric & Care
- Silk, velvet, embroidered and embellished garments are best dry-cleaned.
- Keep leather bags and footwear away from water, direct sunlight and sharp objects.
- Follow the care label on every product.
## 4. Kids' Products & Toys
- Toys and children's products are meant for the age group mentioned on the product page.
- Adult supervision is recommended. Small parts can be a choking hazard for young children.
- Please check labels and instructions before giving any product to a child.
## 5. Stock Availability
All items are in limited stock. If an item is unavailable after you order, we will cancel that item and refund the amount in full.
## 6. Defective or Incorrect Items
If you receive a damaged, defective or incorrect item, please follow the Returns, Refunds & Exchange Policy.`,
delivery:`## 1. Delivery Coverage
We deliver across India to all PIN codes serviced by our courier partners, and we also ship internationally (for example USA, UK, Europe, UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia, Malaysia and Singapore). Choose your country at checkout. If your address is not serviceable, we will cancel the order and refund any payment made.
## 2. Timelines
- Order processing: 1–2 business days after the order is confirmed.
- Delivery: usually 3–5 business days in metro cities and 5–10 business days elsewhere. Remote areas may take longer.
- These are estimates. Festivals, weather, strikes or courier delays may extend delivery time.
## 3. Shipping Charges
- Shipping charges are shown at checkout before you pay.
- Shipping is free on orders above {{FREE}} within India.
- International shipping charges are shown at checkout after you select your country.
- For international orders, customs duties, import taxes and local fees (if any) are payable by the customer. Delivery usually takes 7–15 business days.
## 4. Order Tracking
Once your order is shipped, the courier name and tracking ID appear under "My Orders" on the website.
## 5. Delivery Attempts & Returns to Origin
- Couriers usually attempt delivery up to 3 times. If you are unreachable, the address is incorrect, or the parcel is refused, it may be returned to us (RTO).
- Cash on Delivery may be disabled for customers who repeatedly refuse orders.
- For prepaid orders returned to us, we can re-ship after the address is corrected (a new shipping fee may apply) or refund the amount after deducting shipping charges.
## 6. Receiving Your Parcel
If the package looks torn, tampered with or opened, do not accept it, or record a photo/video in front of the delivery person and inform us immediately. Keeping an unboxing video helps us resolve issues faster.`,
returns:`## 1. Return Window
You may request a return or exchange within 7 days of receiving your order.
## 2. When You Can Return or Exchange
- You received a wrong, damaged or defective item.
- The size does not fit — size exchanges are available subject to stock.
- For damaged, defective or wrong items, please inform us within 48 hours of delivery with photos or an unboxing video.
## 3. Conditions
- Items must be unused, unwashed and unaltered, with all tags and original packaging intact.
- Please share your order ID and clear photos of the item.
## 4. Items That Cannot Be Returned
- Customised, made-to-measure or altered items.
- Used, washed or worn items, and footwear worn outdoors.
- Toys and children's products that are opened, used or missing original packaging (unless defective).
- Items marked "Final Sale" at the time of purchase (unless defective).
- This does not affect your right to a remedy for defective products.
## 5. How to Request a Return
- Contact us on WhatsApp ({{WHATSAPP}}) or email ({{EMAIL}}) with your order ID and photos.
- We will review and, if approved, share the return instructions.
- Returned items are inspected within 3 business days of reaching us.
## 6. Refunds
- Approved refunds are processed within 5–7 business days to the original payment method. Banks may take extra time to credit the amount.
- For Cash on Delivery orders, refunds are made to your bank account or UPI.
- Shipping charges are non-refundable, except when the return is due to our error (wrong or defective item).
## 7. Cancellations
You can cancel an order before it is shipped for a full refund. Contact us on WhatsApp or email to cancel.`,
payment:`## 1. Accepted Payment Methods
- Cash on Delivery (COD)
- UPI: PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm, Airtel Pay
- Credit cards, debit cards and net banking (through Razorpay)
- Bank transfer (NEFT/IMPS)
## 2. UPI & Bank Transfer
Send the payment and enter the UTR / transaction number at checkout. We verify the payment before confirming your order. Orders with a wrong or missing UTR may be delayed or cancelled.
## 3. Cards & Net Banking
We do not store your card details. Payments are processed securely by the payment gateway.
## 4. Failed Payments
If money is debited but the order is not placed, the bank usually refunds it within 5–7 business days. If it does not arrive, contact us with a screenshot of the payment.
## 5. Cash on Delivery
Pay the courier in cash or by UPI when you receive the parcel. Repeated refusal of COD orders may lead to the COD option being disabled for you.
## 6. Fraud Prevention
We may hold, verify or cancel orders that look suspicious to protect you and us. Any amount paid will be refunded in full if an order is cancelled.`,
privacy:`## 1. Information We Collect
Your name, mobile number, delivery address, email (optional) and order details.
## 2. Why We Collect It
To process and deliver orders, verify payments, contact you about your order, and resolve complaints.
## 3. Who We Share It With
Only where necessary: courier partners (delivery), payment gateways, and Google Firebase (sign-in and data storage). We do not sell your personal information.
## 4. Retention
We keep your information for as long as needed to serve you and to meet legal obligations.
## 5. Your Rights
You may ask to view, correct or delete your personal information by writing to {{EMAIL}}. **To delete your data (including data from Google or Facebook sign-in), email {{EMAIL}} with the subject "Delete my data" from your registered email or mobile number. We will delete your account details within 30 days, except records we must keep by law, such as order and tax records.**
## 6. Security
We take reasonable steps to protect your information, but no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.
## 7. Children
Our website is intended for adult shoppers. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.
## 8. Local Storage
We use your browser's storage to remember your cart and sign-in on this device.
## 9. Changes
We may update this policy from time to time. Changes take effect when published on this website.`,
intl:`## Shop Worldwide — International Orders Welcome!
{{STORE}} accepts secure domestic and international payments from customers worldwide. Choose your country at checkout to see the payment options and shipping charge for your location.
## Payment Gateways
{{BRANDS:gw}}
## International Payment Methods
{{BRANDS:intl}}
- The exact options you see at checkout depend on the payment gateway and your country.
## Indian Payment Methods
{{BRANDS:in}}
- Cash on Delivery is available in India only.
## International Shipping Available
Shop from anywhere in the world. Secure checkout, trusted payment gateways and international order support. Shipping availability, delivery time and charges depend on the destination country and are shown at checkout. Customs duties and import taxes, if any, are payable by the customer. See our Shipping & Delivery Policy for details.
## Currency Support
USD | EUR | GBP | CAD | AUD | AED | SGD | INR | JPY | NZD + other currencies supported by the payment gateway.
- Prices on the website are shown in Indian Rupees (INR, ₹).
- International payments may be processed in a supported currency by the payment gateway, or converted by your card issuer at its own exchange rate.
## Secure Checkout | Safe Payments | Worldwide Shopping
Questions? Contact us at {{EMAIL}} or WhatsApp {{WHATSAPP}}.`,
about:`## Who We Are
{{STORE}} is an online fashion store for women and kids. We bring together kurtis, sarees, lehengas, gowns and dresses, footwear, bags, and children's wear, chosen for quality, comfort and style.
## What We Care About
- Quality you can feel in the fabric and finish.
- Honest product descriptions and photographs.
- Secure payments, including UPI, cards, net banking and Cash on Delivery.
- Delivery across India, with an order tracking ID.
- Easy returns as described in our Returns Policy.
## Get in Touch
Email: {{EMAIL}}
WhatsApp: {{WHATSAPP}}
Phone: {{PHONE}}`,
faq:`## How do I place an order?
Add products to your cart, tap Checkout, log in with your mobile number or email, enter your delivery address, choose a payment method and confirm your order.
## Which payment methods can I use?
UPI (PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm and other UPI apps), debit and credit cards, net banking, bank transfer and Cash on Delivery. Available methods are shown at checkout. See our Payment Policy.
## Is Cash on Delivery available?
Yes, where it is shown as an option at checkout.
## How can I track my order?
Open the menu (the three dots at the top), tap Track Order and enter your order ID. You will also see the courier name and tracking ID once your order has shipped.
## How long will delivery take?
Delivery times depend on your location and the courier. Please see our Shipping & Delivery Policy for details.
## Is there a delivery charge?
Delivery is free on orders above {{FREE}}. A delivery charge applies below that amount and is shown at checkout.
## Can I return or exchange a product?
Yes, subject to the conditions in our Returns, Refunds & Exchange Policy. Keep the product unused with its tags and packaging.
## How do I choose the right size?
Each product page lists the available sizes. If you are unsure, message us on WhatsApp ({{WHATSAPP}}) before ordering.
## I received a damaged or wrong item. What should I do?
Contact us on WhatsApp ({{WHATSAPP}}) or email ({{EMAIL}}) with your order ID and photos so we can help quickly.
## How do I contact customer support?
Phone: {{PHONE}}
WhatsApp: {{WHATSAPP}}
Email: {{EMAIL}}`
};

